# Inertia (optional)

Copy this rule into the app's `.cursor/rules/` only when Inertia is installed. Skip for API-only apps.

Match the client already in the repo (Vue, React, or Svelte). Prefer Boost `inertia-*-development` in the app when Boost installed it.

**Do:** share only props the page needs; keep authz on the Laravel side; use existing page/layout conventions.

**Don't:** put secrets in Inertia shared data; duplicate FormRequest rules only on the client; introduce a second client framework.
